From: Lei Wei <quic_leiwei@quicinc.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:34:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: qualcomm: provide PPE phylink and MAC port operations

Add MAC initialization and phylink functions for PPE MAC ports.

Add PPE port MAC MIB statistics functions which are used by netdev ops and
ethtool. For GMAC, a polling task is scheduled to read the MIB counters
periodically to avoid 32bit register counter overflow.

Add PPE port MAC address set and EEE set API functions which will be used
by netdev ops and ethtool.

This function is called when the MTU of an ethernet port is configured. It
limits the size of packet passed through the ethernet port.

Allow egress L2 MTU checks to include the two supported VLAN tag slots.
Keep ingress MRU and routing/flow IP MTUs unchanged so tagged packets
with a full-sized IP payload are not dropped after next-hop insertion.

